WEBVTT

00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:40.844
Hagrid: Harry! Harry!

00:28:41.220 --> 00:28:43.597
Happy birthday.

00:28:45.098 --> 00:28:46.141
Harry:

00:28:50.729 --> 00:28:54.233
You all right, Harry?
You seem very quiet.

00:28:54.608 --> 00:29:00.155
He killed my parents, didn't he?
The one who gave me this.

00:29:00.405 --> 00:29:03.992
You know, Hagrid. I know you do.

00:29:07.913 --> 00:29:12.459
First, and understand this
because it's very important:

00:29:12.668 --> 00:29:15.170
Not all wizards are good.

00:29:15.420 --> 00:29:17.923
Some of them go bad.
A few years ago...

00:29:18.131 --> 00:29:23.136
There was a wizard who went as bad
as you can go. His name was v...

00:29:23.345 --> 00:29:26.974
- His name was v...
- Maybe if you wrote it down?

00:29:27.182 --> 00:29:29.017
No, I can't spell it.

00:29:29.268 --> 00:29:33.522
- All right, Voldemort.
- Voldemort?

00:29:33.689 --> 00:29:36.149
Shh.

00:29:37.484 --> 00:29:39.695
It was dark times, Harry.

00:29:42.030 --> 00:29:45.158
Voldemort started
to gather some followers.

00:29:45.409 --> 00:29:48.704
Brought them over to the dark side.

00:29:50.122 --> 00:29:53.208
Anyone that stood up to him
ended up dead.

00:29:54.376 --> 00:29:57.421
Your parents fought against him.

00:29:57.629 --> 00:30:01.425
But nobody lived once
he decided to kill them.

00:30:05.804 --> 00:30:08.390
Nobody, not one.

00:30:08.557 --> 00:30:10.976
Except you.

00:30:12.978 --> 00:30:17.065
Me? Voldemort tried to kill me?

00:30:17.566 --> 00:30:21.737
Yes. That ain't no ordinary cut
on your forehead, Harry.

00:30:22.029 --> 00:30:27.743
A Mark like that only comes from being
touched by a curse, an evil curse.

00:30:27.993 --> 00:30:31.580
What happened to v...?
To you-know-who?

00:30:32.748 --> 00:30:36.084
Well, some say he died.

00:30:36.335 --> 00:30:38.754
Codswallop, in my opinion.

00:30:38.962 --> 00:30:42.215
Nope, I reckon he's out there still...

00:30:42.424 --> 00:30:45.385
Too tired to carry on.

00:30:45.594 --> 00:30:51.016
But one thing's certain. Something
about you stumped him that night.

00:30:51.266 --> 00:30:55.520
That's why you're famous.
That's why everybody knows your name.

00:30:55.979 --> 00:30:59.608
You're the boy who lived.

00:31:08.992 --> 00:31:11.703
What are you looking at?
00:31:13.455 --> 00:31:15.457
Blimey, is that the time?

00:31:15.624 --> 00:31:19.628
I'm gonna have to leave you.
Dumbledore will be wanting his...

00:31:19.878 --> 00:31:24.758
Well, he'll be wanting to see me.
Your train leaves in 10 minutes.

00:31:24.966 --> 00:31:30.305
Here's your ticket. Stick to your ticket,
that's very important.

00:31:33.141 --> 00:31:35.435
"Platform 9 3/4"?
